#: ../developer/minimal-identity.md:1
msgid "Minimal Agent identity"
msgstr "Agent 只保存最少的身份信息"

#: ../developer/minimal-identity.md:3
msgid ""
"Cloud Agent deliberately keeps identity small. It stores the Gateway user"
" ID and the issuer that minted it, but it does not copy Gateway account "
"metadata into identity claims or derive permissions from account roles. "
"The Gateway makes the current access decision, and Cloud Agent rechecks "
"that decision instead of reading permissions from the session. The [Agent"
" admission contract](agent-access-policy.md) defines those checks."
msgstr ""
"Cloud Agent 有意只保存最少的身份信息：网关的用户 ID，以及签发这个 ID "
"的签发方。网关账号的其他资料不会抄进身份声明，权限也不从账号角色推出来。能不能访问，由网关当场判定；Cloud Agent "
"每次都向网关重新确认，而不是从会话里读权限。具体怎么检查，见 [Agent 准入契约](agent-access-policy.md)。"

