msgstr "校验"

#: ../developer/minimal-identity.md
msgid "Gateway identity token"
msgstr "网关身份令牌"

#: ../developer/minimal-identity.md
msgid "`iss`, `aud`, `sub`, `iat`, `exp`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/minimal-identity.md
msgid ""
"RS256 signature through JWKS, exact configured issuer, `cloud-agent` "
"audience and expiry"
msgstr "通过 JWKS 校验 RS256 签名；签发方必须和配置完全一致，受众必须是 `cloud-agent`，并且未过期"

#: ../developer/minimal-identity.md
msgid "Agent session"
msgstr "Agent 会话"

#: ../developer/minimal-identity.md
msgid "`sub`, `gateway_issuer`, `iat`, `exp`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/minimal-identity.md
msgid ""
"HS256 signature with `AGENT_SESSION_SECRET`, exact issuer, expiry and "
"exact claim set"
msgstr "用 `AGENT_SESSION_SECRET` 校验 HS256 签名；签发方完全一致、未过期，且声明字段不多不少"

#: ../developer/minimal-identity.md:17
msgid ""
"Older Gateways may send additional profile claims. Agent discards them at"
" verification. The session's `gateway_issuer` names the upstream identity"
" authority; Agent signs the session itself. Sessions last 30 days. Legacy"
" cookies missing the issuer or containing profile claims, and cookies "
"from another issuer, are rejected. Users must sign in again after "
"upgrading from those formats."
msgstr ""
"旧版网关可能还会带上额外的个人资料声明，Agent 在校验时直接丢掉。会话里的 `gateway_issuer` "
"标明上游的身份签发方，而会话本身由 Agent 签名，有效期 30 天。缺少签发方或带有个人资料声明的旧 cookie，以及来自其他签发方的 "
"cookie，都会被拒绝。所以从这些旧格式升级之后，用户需要重新登录一次。"

#: ../developer/minimal-identity.md:23
msgid ""
"Where cookies carry `Secure` (the default), the session is read only from"
" `__Host-cloud_agent_session` and a sign-in in progress only from "
"`__Host-cloud_agent_login`. Another host on the same site can set a "
"cookie of the plain name, so a `cloud_agent_session` cookie left from "
"before the prefix signs nobody in; a browser that holds only that one "
"signs in again. Plain-HTTP local stacks, where browsers refuse the "
"prefix, keep the plain names; see `AGENT_SESSION_COOKIE_SECURE` in "
"[ENVIRONMENT.md](../../ENVIRONMENT.md)."
msgstr ""
"cookie 带 `Secure` 时（默认如此），会话只从 `__Host-cloud_agent_session` 读取，进行到一半的登录只从"
" `__Host-cloud_agent_login` 读取。同一站点下的其他主机能设置普通名字的 cookie，所以加前缀之前留下的 "
"`cloud_agent_session` cookie 不会让任何人登录；浏览器里如果只剩这一个，就要重新登录。纯 HTTP "
"的本地环境里，浏览器会拒绝这个前缀，所以仍用普通名字；见 [ENVIRONMENT.md](../../ENVIRONMENT.md) 里的 "
"`AGENT_SESSION_COOKIE_SECURE`。"

#: ../developer/minimal-identity.md:31
msgid ""
"An active account without Agent permission may establish a minimal "
"session for the access-required page. A missing/inactive account is "
"refused through the access contract's typed `subject_unavailable` error. "
"Unreadable responses and proxy failures cannot establish access."
msgstr ""
"状态正常、但没有 Agent 权限的账号，可以建立一个最小会话，用来显示\"需要访问权限\"页面。不存在或已停用的账号，会收到访问契约里带类型的 "
"`subject_unavailable` 错误，无法登录。响应无法解析或代理出错时，都不会放行。"

#: ../developer/minimal-identity.md:36
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`GET /v1/session/me` returns `id` and `agent_access`. My Settings offers "
"a Profile section with a read-only account email, editable first and last"
" names, and an uploaded profile picture. Email is read on demand from the"
" Gateway's existing `/internal/users/{user_id}/status` lookup and is "
"never stored in Agent or added to session claims. That response's role "
"and account-status fields do not confer Agent permissions; current "
"admission is still checked through `agent-access`."
msgstr ""
"`GET /v1/session/me` 返回 `id` 和 `agent_access`。My Settings 里有一个 Profile "
"页面：账号邮箱只读，名和姓可以编辑，还可以上传头像。邮箱是需要时才从网关现有的 "
"`/internal/users/{user_id}/status` 接口查来的，Agent "
"从不存储，也不放进会话声明。这个接口返回的角色和账号状态字段不授予任何 Agent 权限；当前能否访问，仍以 `agent-access` "
"的检查结果为准。"

#: ../developer/minimal-identity.md:43
msgid ""
"The names and picture are owner-authored Cloud Agent display data, "
"separate from Gateway login identity and the automatically generated "
"homepage companion. The homepage and Profile editor prefer an uploaded "
"profile picture. When none is saved, they use the owner's Pokémon "
"companion. Removing a picture restores the companion. The companion's "
"habitat and badges come from work insights (`work_insights.py`), derived "
"again on each read from the owner's latest requests; they are not memory "
"and never change the saved picture. `GET` and revision-checked `PATCH "
"/v1/agent/profile` require current Agent admission and return `Cache-"
"Control: no-store`. Names allow up to 100 characters each. PNG, JPEG, and"
" WebP uploads are limited to 2 MiB and 16 million pixels; the server re-"
"encodes them as metadata-free PNGs up to 512 by 512 pixels before saving."
" Migration `0063_user_profiles` adds `agent_user_profiles`; it contains "
"no email, roles, or credentials. Profile editing does not modify Gateway "
"account details."
msgstr ""
"名字和头像是所有者自己填写的 Cloud Agent 显示信息，和网关的登录身份无关，也和首页上自动生成的伙伴形象无关。首页和 Profile "
"编辑页优先显示上传的头像；没有上传时，显示所有者的宝可梦伙伴；删掉头像，就会换回伙伴形象。伙伴的栖息地和徽章来自工作洞察（`work_insights.py`），每次读取时都根据所有者最近的请求重新计算；它们不属于记忆功能，也永远不会改动已保存的头像。`GET`"
" 和带修订号检查的 `PATCH /v1/agent/profile` 都要求当前有 Agent 准入，并返回 `Cache-Control: "
"no-store`。名和姓各自最多 100 个字符。上传的 PNG、JPEG 和 WebP 不能超过 2 MiB、1600 "
"万像素；服务器保存前会把它们重新编码成不带元数据的 PNG，尺寸最大 512×512 像素。迁移 `0063_user_profiles` 新建了"
" `agent_user_profiles` 表，里面没有邮箱、角色或凭据。编辑 Profile 不会改动网关里的账号信息。"

#: ../developer/minimal-identity.md:57
msgid ""
"The frontend shares successful profile and homepage-insights reads in "
"memory, keyed by account. Returning to New task displays the cached "
"avatar immediately while refreshing in the background; a failed refresh "
"preserves the last image. Profile saves update the shared cache "
"immediately and supersede older reads. The cache lasts only within the "
"browser tab and is cleared before sign-out or an account change; it does "
"not change the APIs' `Cache-Control: no-store` policy."
msgstr ""
"前端会把成功读到的个人资料和首页洞察放在内存里，按账号共享。回到 New task "
"页面时，先立即显示缓存的头像，同时在后台刷新；刷新失败就继续显示上一张。保存 Profile "
"会立即更新这份共享缓存，并让更早发出的读取结果作废。缓存只在当前浏览器标签页里有效，退出登录或切换账号之前会被清空；它不影响各 API 的 "
"`Cache-Control: no-store` 策略。"

#: ../developer/minimal-identity.md:64
msgid ""
"Tasks, messages, connection identifiers, encrypted Git/MCP credentials, "
"and other user-authored content remain Agent-owned data."
msgstr "任务、消息、连接标识、加密存储的 Git/MCP 凭据，以及用户编写的其他内容，仍然是 Agent 自己的数据。"

#: ../developer/minimal-identity.md:67
msgid ""
"There is no individual session-revocation table. A copied cookie remains "
"valid until expiry; protected requests still require current Gateway "
"access. Rotating `AGENT_SESSION_SECRET` invalidates every session. "
"Withdrawing Gateway permission prevents subsequent protected requests."
msgstr ""
"系统没有逐个吊销会话的表。被人复制走的 cookie 在过期前一直有效，但受保护的请求仍然要求网关当前允许访问。轮换 "
"`AGENT_SESSION_SECRET` 会让所有会话一起失效。在网关上收回权限，之后的受保护请求就都会被拒绝。"

#: ../developer/minimal-identity.md:72
msgid "Database identity boundary"
msgstr "数据库身份边界"

#: ../developer/minimal-identity.md:74
msgid ""
"`agent_identity_namespace` has one record binding the database to a "
"`GATEWAY_ISSUER`. Both the main API and MCP listener validate the binding"
" before starting workers. The binding never rewrites owner IDs or infers "
"their issuer from old rows. Its table is part of `0001_schema_baseline`; "
"the retired migration chain called this change `0029_identity_namespace`."
msgstr ""
"`agent_identity_namespace` 表里只有一条记录，把这个数据库绑定到某个 `GATEWAY_ISSUER`。主 API 和 "
"MCP 监听器在启动 worker 之前都会检查这个绑定。绑定不会改写所有者 ID，也不会根据旧数据去猜它们来自哪个签发方。这张表属于 "
"`0001_schema_baseline`；在已经退役的旧迁移链里，这项改动叫 `0029_identity_namespace`。"

