msgstr "已有所有者数据，没有绑定，已配置签发方"

#: ../developer/minimal-identity.md
msgid "Refuse until an operator explicitly adopts the original issuer"
msgstr "拒绝启动，直到运维人员明确认定原来的签发方"

#: ../developer/minimal-identity.md
msgid "Bound to the configured issuer"
msgstr "已绑定，且和配置的签发方一致"

#: ../developer/minimal-identity.md
msgid "Continue"
msgstr "正常继续"

#: ../developer/minimal-identity.md
msgid "Bound to another issuer, or issuer removed after binding"
msgstr "绑定的是另一个签发方，或者绑定后又删掉了签发方配置"

#: ../developer/minimal-identity.md
msgid "Refuse"
msgstr "拒绝启动"

#: ../developer/minimal-identity.md
msgid "Neither Gateway configuration nor binding"
msgstr "既没有网关配置，也没有绑定"

#: ../developer/minimal-identity.md
msgid ""
"Allow local infrastructure administration; identity/session "
"authentication stays unavailable"
msgstr "允许本地的基础设施管理；身份和会话认证不可用"

#: ../developer/minimal-identity.md:88
msgid ""
"Concurrent initialization is serialized. Adoption can fill an absent "
"binding; it cannot replace one. Use the exact `iss` signed by the "
"original Gateway. `GATEWAY_BASE_URL` and JWKS URLs are transport "
"locations and can change without changing the identity namespace. "
"Independent Gateways must use distinct issuers. Replacing the Gateway's "
"account database with unrelated identities under the same issuer is not a"
" supported migration."
msgstr ""
"多个进程同时初始化时会排队依次执行。认定（adopt）只能补上缺失的绑定，不能替换已有的绑定。请使用原网关实际签发的 `iss` "
"值，一字不差。`GATEWAY_BASE_URL` 和 JWKS URL "
"只是访问地址，可以改，不影响身份命名空间。相互独立的网关必须使用不同的签发方。在同一个签发方下，把网关的账号数据库换成一批毫不相干的身份，这种做法不受支持。"

#: ../developer/minimal-identity.md:95
msgid "Upgrade an existing deployment"
msgstr "升级现有部署"

#: ../developer/minimal-identity.md:97
msgid ""
"Prepare each environment before its distribution advances the Agent "
"release. Merging upstream source does not deploy a named environment, and"
" existing owner rows do not reveal the original Gateway issuer."
msgstr ""
"在发行版把 Agent "
"升级到新版本之前，先把每个环境准备好。合并上游源代码并不会部署到任何一个具体的环境；而且光看已有的所有者数据，也看不出原来的网关签发方是什么。"

#: ../developer/minimal-identity.md:101
msgid ""
"Verify the original Gateway's effective issuer from its running "
"environment. In the Gateway implementation used by the original rollout, "
"`serving.utils.identity_tokens.issuer()` reads `IDENTITY_ISSUER`, falls "
"back to `base_url`, and removes trailing slashes. Pin the verified "
"effective value as Gateway `IDENTITY_ISSUER` and Agent `GATEWAY_ISSUER`. "
"Verify staging and production separately."
msgstr ""
"从原网关的运行环境里，确认它实际使用的签发方。在最初上线时使用的网关实现中，`serving.utils.identity_tokens.issuer()`"
" 先读 `IDENTITY_ISSUER`，没有就用 `base_url`，并去掉末尾的斜杠。把确认后的实际值同时固定写进网关的 "
"`IDENTITY_ISSUER` 和 Agent 的 `GATEWAY_ISSUER`。staging 和 production 要分别确认。"

#: ../developer/minimal-identity.md:107
msgid ""
"Back up the Agent database. If it still uses the migration chain from "
"before 2026-09-10, follow the conversion/rebuild procedure in "
"[operations](operations.md) before running migrations. `upgrade head` "
"cannot directly convert a retired revision stamp. With the supported "
"schema, migrate to head using the prepared release image."
msgstr ""
"备份 Agent 数据库。如果它还在用 2026-09-10 "
"之前的迁移链，运行迁移前先按[运维手册](operations.md)里的转换或重建流程处理；`upgrade head` "
"无法直接处理已退役的修订号标记。如果已经是受支持的 schema，就用准备好的发布镜像迁移到 head。"

#: ../developer/minimal-identity.md:112
msgid ""
"Adopt existing owner data into its original issuer, then verify the "
"binding. In an environment with the Agent package and database "
"configuration:"
msgstr "把已有的所有者数据认定为属于原来的签发方，然后检查绑定。在装有 Agent 包、并配置好数据库的环境里运行："

#: ../developer/minimal-identity.md:120
msgid ""
"The adoption argument must exactly match `GATEWAY_ISSUER`. It changes "
"only an absent binding, preserving tasks, connections and owner IDs. "
"There is no persistent auto-adoption switch."
msgstr ""
"认定时传入的签发方必须和 `GATEWAY_ISSUER` 完全一致。这一步只会补上缺失的绑定，任务、连接和所有者 ID "
"都原样保留。没有可以长期开着的自动认定开关。"

#: ../developer/minimal-identity.md:124
msgid ""
"For Compose, use the existing project name, active environment file and "
"prepared checkout:"
msgstr "用 Compose 部署时，沿用现有的项目名、当前生效的环境文件和准备好的本地仓库："

#: ../developer/minimal-identity.md:140
msgid ""
"These commands require the existing Postgres service to be running. They "
"prepare the binding without replacing the API or MCP relay."
msgstr "这些命令需要现有的 Postgres 服务正在运行。它们只负责准备绑定，不会替换 API 或 MCP 中继。"

#: ../developer/minimal-identity.md:142
msgid ""
"Release Agent backend and web app together through the deployment "
"workflow. Verify fresh login, `/me`, owner/admin permissions and "
"ownership of existing tasks. Confirm legacy cookies are rejected."
msgstr ""
"通过部署流程，同时发布 Agent 后端和 Web 应用。检查全新登录、`/me`、所有者和管理员权限，以及已有任务的归属是否正确。确认旧 "
"cookie 会被拒绝。"

#: ../developer/minimal-identity.md:146
msgid ""
"`deploy/control-plane/deploy.sh` runs the identity check after migration "
"and before bootstrap, host-readiness waiting or API/MCP replacement. "
"Unadopted owner data, a missing required issuer or a conflicting binding "
"stops that deployment. The host rollout can run in parallel, so prepare "
"the identity boundary first. Both Compose listeners use the same issuer."
msgstr ""
"`deploy/control-plane/deploy.sh` 会在迁移完成之后、启动初始化、等待主机就绪和替换 API/MCP "
"之前，先做身份检查。只要有未认定归属的所有者数据、缺少必需的签发方，或者绑定冲突，这次部署就会中止。主机的上线可能同时在进行，所以要先把身份边界准备好。两个"
" Compose 监听器用的是同一个签发方。"

#: ../developer/minimal-identity.md:152
msgid ""
"A permission-capable Gateway may remove profile claims before or after "
"this Agent release; Agent treats them as optional. Older Gateways without"
" the access contract remain incompatible. The local Docker stack uses the"
" fixed issuer `freeinference-local`; existing unbound demo owner data "
"needs explicit adoption of that issuer too."
msgstr ""
"支持权限判定的网关，在这次 Agent 发布之前或之后去掉个人资料声明都可以，Agent "
"把这些声明当作可有可无。不支持访问契约的旧版网关仍然不兼容。本地 Docker 环境使用固定的签发方 `freeinference-"
"local`；已有但还没绑定的演示数据，同样需要明确认定这个签发方。"

#: ../developer/minimal-identity.md:158
msgid "Rollback and restore constraints"
msgstr "回滚和恢复时的限制"

#: ../developer/minimal-identity.md:160
msgid ""
"Do not use `alembic downgrade base` to undo identity binding: the "
"baseline drops owner tables and `agent_identity_namespace` together. No "
"partial downgrade preserves owner data while removing only this record."
msgstr ""
"不要用 `alembic downgrade base` 来撤销身份绑定：baseline 会把所有者相关的表和 "
"`agent_identity_namespace` 一起删掉。没有哪种局部降级能只删掉这条记录、同时保住所有者数据。"

#: ../developer/minimal-identity.md:164
msgid ""
"Re-upgrading an empty database automatically binds the currently "
"configured issuer. It cannot protect history already deleted by the "
"downgrade."
msgstr "对空数据库重新升级时，会自动绑定当前配置的签发方；但降级时已经删掉的历史，它也救不回来。"

#: ../developer/minimal-identity.md:166
msgid ""
"Restoring owner rows without their matching binding causes the identity "
"check to fail. Restore the original binding or explicitly adopt the "
"verified original issuer using the procedure above."
msgstr "如果恢复了所有者数据，却没有恢复对应的绑定，身份检查就会失败。这时要么恢复原来的绑定，要么按上面的流程，明确认定核实过的原签发方。"

#: ../developer/minimal-identity.md:170
msgid ""
"An older Agent binary may accept profile cookies and ignore the stored "
"issuer. Prefer a compatible forward fix, or stop Agent while keeping the "
"Gateway available. Back up and restore the binding with the data whose "
"owners it names."
msgstr ""
"旧版 Agent 可能会接受带个人资料的 cookie，并且无视已保存的签发方。所以出问题时，优先做兼容的向前修复；或者先停掉 "
"Agent，让网关继续运行。备份和恢复绑定时，要和它所指向的那批所有者数据放在一起。"

#: ../developer/minimal-identity.md:174
msgid ""
"The implementation is in "
"[`identity.py`](../../apps/backend/cloud_agent/identity.py), "
"[`identity_namespace.py`](../../apps/backend/cloud_agent/identity_namespace.py)"
" and "
"[`lifespan.py`](../../apps/backend/cloud_agent/bootstrap/lifespan.py)."
msgstr ""
"实现代码在 "
"[`identity.py`](../../apps/backend/cloud_agent/identity.py)、[`identity_namespace.py`](../../apps/backend/cloud_agent/identity_namespace.py)"
" 和 [`lifespan.py`](../../apps/backend/cloud_agent/bootstrap/lifespan.py)。"

